CROSBI publication params, needs `wiki.srce.hr/display/CRORIS/CROSBI+API` which neither of us can reach, so either find it mirrored or mail `podrska@croris.hr`. Whether the croris.hr test environment banner means the person data is fake. And how many faculties besides FER publish staff pages with competencies and publications, which needs the same per faculty check as the `/predmet/` tier.

